# caption: Commit an IR graph rewrite only after structural and semantic checks succeed.

REQUIRE valid IR, matched region and version, established rule premises
ENSURE valid committed replacement or unchanged visible IR
allocate replacement privately and connect its preserved interface
validate types, arities, dominance, control successors, and memory results
revalidate match and analysis versions at the commit boundary
redirect all selected uses according to the rule's sharing policy
publish replacement and retire unreachable old nodes safely
invalidate or update affected analyses and reverse-use indexes

